  "bio": "Experience the artistry of Farbstich Tattoo Studio, where masterful black & gray, realism, and cover-up tattoos transform skin into stunning canvases. Nestled in the creative heart of 50259 Pulheim, Farbstich is open Monday to Friday from 12 to 20 o'clock and Saturdays from 12 to 16 o'clock, offering a haven for both local patrons and visiting guest artists alike. Secure your session with our skilled artisans and usher in your next ink masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nDein HighClass Tattoo- & Piercing Studio\n———————————————-\n🕰𝗠𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗴-𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗴 𝟭𝟮-𝟮𝟬 𝗨𝗵𝗿\n🕰𝗦𝗮𝗺𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗴 𝟭𝟮-𝟭𝟲 𝗨𝗵𝗿\n📍𝟱𝟬𝟮𝟱𝟵 𝗣𝘂𝗹𝗵𝗲𝗶𝗺\n⬇️ 𝘼𝙡𝙡𝙚 𝙄𝙣𝙛𝙤𝙨 𝙛𝙞𝙣𝙙𝙚𝙨𝙩 𝙙𝙪 𝙝𝙞𝙚𝙧 ⬇️\n\nDein HighClass Tattoo- & Piercing Studio\n———————————————-\n🕰𝗠𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗴-𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗴 𝟭𝟮-𝟮𝟬 𝗨𝗵𝗿\n🕰𝗦𝗮𝗺𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗴 𝟭𝟮-𝟭𝟲 𝗨𝗵𝗿\n📍𝟱𝟬𝟮𝟱𝟵 𝗣𝘂𝗹𝗵𝗲𝗶𝗺\n⬇️ 𝘼𝙡𝙡𝙚 𝙄𝙣𝙛𝙤𝙨 𝙛𝙞𝙣𝙙𝙚𝙨𝙩 𝙙𝙪 𝙝𝙞𝙚𝙧 ⬇️",
